cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LLM-as-Judge in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LLM-as-Judge: an open-source, free-tier LLM evaluation platform"
abstract: >-
  An evaluation platform that uses an LLM as a judge for pairwise, pointwise,
  reference-based, ranking, RAG and agent evaluation, with position-bias
  mitigation and reliability analytics. One engine powers a Python library,
  a CLI, a REST API and a Streamlit dashboard, and it runs on free tiers or
  entirely offline.
authors:
